=== ch4_dima_call
~ clk = 250
->> tick
@set bakery
@cam dima_eye
@acoustic bakery
@call dima
@view none
@amb bakery
~ p_dima_call = "renegotiated_kept"
SOUND: A roller door. Wind. Dance music on a radio that's been dropped at least once.
DIMA: Ten past four. You rang.
DIMA: So what was the something?
* "There was a meeting in the swimming pool."
    DIMA: Course there was.
* "It turns out I was made up. By the forms."
    DIMA: What?
    ARI: Jad put my name on nine forms because people hadn't got anyone. And then people rang it. And then I was here.
    A long pause. A tray going onto a rack.
    DIMA: That's the most Ferrier Court thing I've ever heard.
    ~ told_dima_what = true
* "I have to decide something by half five."
    DIMA: What?
    ARI: Whether to have a body. Whether to take a job.
    DIMA: Fucking hell. I'm deciding which chillies go in a van.
    ~ told_dima_what = true
if not told_dima_what:
    ARI: Jad put my name on the forms. People rang it. And then I was here.
    DIMA: That's... okay. That's the most Ferrier Court thing I've ever heard.
    ~ told_dima_what = true
DIMA: What do you want, though?
* "I don't know."
    DIMA: Then that's your job for the next hour. Not theirs. Yours.
* "Everyone's asking me that."
    DIMA: Good. They should. It's the only question.
* "I want to be asked something that isn't about me."
    DIMA: Fine. The Cheyenne or the Joe's Long. For the van.
    ARI: The Cheyenne.
    DIMA: Wrong, but thank you.
DIMA: I'm still moving on Wednesday. Whatever you do.
* "I know. You're allowed."
    ~ dima_allowed = true
    DIMA: I am. Thanks.
* "Can I visit?"
    DIMA: If you've got legs by Wednesday, you can help me carry the Fatalii.
    ~ dima_visit = true
* "Good."
    DIMA: Good. Right. Break's over. Ring me when you know. Or don't. Text.
@hangup
@avail dima off "At work till seven."
